   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Guideline summaries are summaries of summaries<br>- Imaging is confounded by medication<br>- Genetics describes populations"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2750,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- Which factors predict individual course trajectories, and how well?<br>- How do guideline rankings change when new trials appear?<br>- Which mechanism hypothesis would, if confirmed, change clinical practice?"
  },
